WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.378 --> 00:00:07.007
Are you behind the fake Chariot?
Are you mocking me?

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:10.010
Why are you here?

00:00:11.219 --> 00:00:13.013
There's something I want to ask.

00:00:13.096 --> 00:00:17.475
You can answer all questions about
the past, present and future, can't you?

00:00:19.894 --> 00:00:22.063
Not all.

00:00:22.814 --> 00:00:28.737
But what I cannot answer, nobody can.

00:00:30.405 --> 00:00:33.158
I want you to tell me about my future.

00:00:33.950 --> 00:00:36.911
Can I really become a witch like Chariot?

00:00:38.496 --> 00:00:39.664
Foolishness.

00:00:40.248 --> 00:00:42.834
This is more important to me than my life!

00:00:47.338 --> 00:00:50.216
Is this the future you wish?

00:00:59.768 --> 00:01:02.312
That's my... dream.

00:01:04.189 --> 00:01:06.858
Step through the door.

00:01:07.650 --> 00:01:10.862
The future will be yours.

00:01:20.622 --> 00:01:26.419
But when you get the bright future,
you will lose your past.

00:01:27.212 --> 00:01:28.254
What do you mean?

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:31.716
The future comes with a price.

00:01:32.675 --> 00:01:34.427
You must sacrifice your past.

00:01:52.403 --> 00:01:54.114
Your useless past...

00:01:54.197 --> 00:01:55.615
will be erased.

00:02:04.082 --> 00:02:05.166
Wait!

00:02:06.543 --> 00:02:07.836
Don't erase them!

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:10.130
My past is full of failures

00:02:10.213 --> 00:02:12.841
and almost nothing went right,

00:02:12.924 --> 00:02:14.843
but I don't want to erase those memories!

00:02:14.926 --> 00:02:16.427
Why?

00:02:16.511 --> 00:02:20.056
They are not worth saving.

00:02:20.682 --> 00:02:24.352
The tears, the frustrations, the laughs...

00:02:24.435 --> 00:02:28.398
they're all mine. No one else's.

00:02:28.481 --> 00:02:31.025
They're everything I have done.

00:02:31.109 --> 00:02:32.735
I did my best!

00:02:33.570 --> 00:02:35.238
I'm not going to erase them!

00:02:35.947 --> 00:02:37.115
Are you all right...

00:02:38.241 --> 00:02:40.201
with not becoming Chariot?

00:02:40.285 --> 00:02:41.828
I can be!

00:02:41.953 --> 00:02:44.706
I will be an amazing witch
through my own hard work.

00:02:46.040 --> 00:02:47.959
The professor taught me...

00:02:49.252 --> 00:02:55.133
"You don't get that which you dream of,
but what you work hard for."

00:02:55.717 --> 00:02:57.635
Phaidoari...

00:03:01.222 --> 00:03:03.600
Afairrynghor!

